/address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TOSHIBA LIGHTING &amp; TECHNOLOGY</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ASHIDA, SEIJI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HONDA, HISASHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOSHIBA LIGHTING &amp; TECHNOLOGY CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ASHIDA SEIJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HONDA HISASHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ASHIDA, SEIJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HONDA, HISASHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A high-pressure discharge lamp comprises a transparent ceramic discharge container (1), a feeding conductor (2), a pair of electrodes (3, 3), a seal (4) of ceramic sealing compound, and a discharge medium. The discharge container has a capacity equal to or less than 0.1 cc. The distance (d1) between the end of the electrode and the inner surface of the transparent discharge container is 1.0 mm or greater in the direction perpendicular to the axis of the transparent discharge container.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une lampe à décharge haute pression constituée d'un contenant à décharge céramique transparent (1), d'un conducteur d'alimentation (2), de deux électrodes (3, 3), d'un joint d'étanchéité (4) à base d'un mastic d'étanchéité céramique, et d'un milieu à décharge. Le contenant à décharge présente une capacité inférieure ou égale à 0,1 cc, la distance (d1) séparant l'extrémité d'une électrode et la surface supérieure de ce contenant à décharge transparent étant supérieure ou égale à 1,0 mm, dans le sens perpendiculaire à l'axe dudit contenant à décharge transparent.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>